{
 "duration": 81.346,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "Zeythar. It's 2:30 AM. I said I'd sleep at ten.",
   "start": 0.1,
   "end": 5.08,
   "file": "vo/lines/l01.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "You said that yesterday. And on Tuesday. I keep records.",
   "start": 5.34,
   "end": 9.628,
   "file": "vo/lines/l02.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "I'm not even doing anything. I'm just replaying a conversation from 2019.",
   "start": 9.888,
   "end": 14.348,
   "file": "vo/lines/l03.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "Ah. The committee is in session.",
   "start": 14.608,
   "end": 17.206,
   "file": "vo/lines/l04.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "The what?",
   "start": 17.466,
   "end": 18.086,
   "file": "vo/lines/l05.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "Every awkward thing you have ever said, reviewed nightly. Attendance is mandatory.",
   "start": 18.346,
   "end": 23.834,
   "file": "vo/lines/l06.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "Why does it only meet at night?!",
   "start": 24.094,
   "end": 26.234,
   "file": "vo/lines/l07.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "Because during the day, you never give it an appointment.",
   "start": 26.494,
   "end": 29.744,
   "file": "vo/lines/l08.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "Okay, wise one. How do I make it stop?",
   "start": 30.004,
   "end": 34.024,
   "file": "vo/lines/l09.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "Give it ten minutes before dinner. With a pen. Every worry, on paper.",
   "start": 34.284,
   "end": 39.672,
   "file": "vo/lines/l10.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "That's it? That's the ancient wisdom?",
   "start": 39.932,
   "end": 43.018,
   "file": "vo/lines/l11.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "The ancient wisdom was \"go to sleep.\" Your species declined.",
   "start": 43.278,
   "end": 48.176,
   "file": "vo/lines/l12.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "…Rude.",
   "start": 48.436,
   "end": 50.086,
   "file": "vo/lines/l13.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "Can I tell you something weird? Night is the only time nobody needs anything from me.",
   "start": 51.226,
   "end": 56.514,
   "file": "vo/lines/l14.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "That is not weird. You are not avoiding sleep. You are taking back your day.",
   "start": 57.524,
   "end": 62.48,
   "file": "vo/lines/l15.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l16",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "…Oh.",
   "start": 62.74,
   "end": 63.97,
   "file": "vo/lines/l16.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l17",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "So take some of it back while the sun is up. Then the night won't have to steal it for you.",
   "start": 64.23,
   "end": 68.848,
   "file": "vo/lines/l17.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l18",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "Okay. Going to sleep. Right now.",
   "start": 69.608,
   "end": 71.936,
   "file": "vo/lines/l18.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l19",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "You have said that four times.",
   "start": 72.196,
   "end": 74.276,
   "file": "vo/lines/l19.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l20",
   "who": "L",
   "text": "Goodnight, Zeythar.",
   "start": 74.536,
   "end": 75.696,
   "file": "vo/lines/l20.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "id": "l21",
   "who": "Z",
   "text": "It is 2:47.",
   "start": 75.956,
   "end": 77.946,
   "file": "vo/lines/l21.wav",
   "sr": 24000
  }
 ]
}